 "text": {
  "en": {
   "headline": "Can't tell yet whether air temperature near the ground in Khulna division changed over 1980–2025. That is not the same as no change.",
   "howMuch": [
    "Rate: −0.17 °C per decade (95% range −0.33 °C to −0.03 °C).",
    "Total change over 1980–2025: −0.77 °C.",
    "That is bigger than the usual year-to-year ups and downs."
   ],
   "howSure": [
    "One of 12 tests we registered in advance; after correcting for all of them, p = 0.079.",
    "Mann–Kendall test allowing for year-to-year memory, before correction: p = 0.009.",
    "That is above the 0.05 line we set in advance, so we can't tell yet."
   ],
   "checks": [
    "No missing years.",
    "No documented data change falls inside these years.",
    "No single year decides the answer.",
    "5 of 5 other windows agree.",
    "A jump around 1997 stands out (Pettitt test, a flag only: it does not change the verdict)."
   ],
   "practical": [
    "We decided in advance that a change of 0.10 °C per decade matters. The 95% range includes smaller changes, so it may or may not matter."
   ],
   "overturn": [
    "The answer leans most on 2020: without it, p = 0.023.",
    "The weakest of the other windows, 1980–2019, gives −0.20 °C per decade.",
    "If year-to-year memory were stronger or slower than our model assumes, the test would be too eager. Our check found no sign of that here."
   ],
   "notes": [
    "This comes from a model that blends many observations (a reanalysis). Models can shift when the observations they use change."
   ]
